      "content": "This refresh can overwrite a subsequent reflection save. After the asked Action save finishes, `asking` is cleared while `refreshTrade` may still be awaiting `DailyReview.open`; the remaining reflection can then be saved. If that save completes before the earlier open response arrives, `reopenAndApply` unconditionally applies the older Review, rolling back the newer completion/progress and binding. The selection guard only protects the card detail, not that overview update. Invalidate refresh responses when a newer save is applied (or serialize saves with the refresh), and cover this ordering with deferred responses.",
